---
import "@fontsource-variable/archivo";
import "@fontsource-variable/source-code-pro";
import "../styles/global.css";

interface Props {
  title: string;
  description: string;
}

const { title, description } = Astro.props;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f3f0e8" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <title>{title}</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <!--
    THESIS: Sickle reads as an annotated compiler diagnostic, refusing the standard split hero and feature-card grid.
    OWN-WORLD: Warm listing paper, carbon ink, registration violet, correction red, ruled annotations, and square tool controls.
    STORY: See CCL become a model, choose direct or Serde access, select exact features, then copy the Cargo command.
    FIRST VIEWPORT: A full-width source sheet dominates; the headline occupies its diagnostic margin and the install action locks to its lower tool rail.
    FORM: Compiler Diagnostic Sheet, first on the grounded list, selected from seed cdf126de.
    FINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, DESIGN.md, and every shipping raster carrying its provenance
    -->
    <slot />
  </body>
</html>
